{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21010","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21010-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21010-0","text":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21010-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21010-1","text":"少女不解地比划着手中的细剑。\n自己的剑要双手才能挥舞，这样的剑也能算剑？这样的剑也能杀敌？\n\n剑的主人倒是对此毫不在意，毕竟——\n杀不杀敌又不在剑，全在心。\n用的重剑还是细剑，又有什么区别。","speaker":""}]}
